Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You donated 10,000 rupees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.89,0:00:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Will your tax really fall by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.79,0:00:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,10,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.51,0:00:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kartik Purnima is a day of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,giving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people believe donations cut their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.95,0:00:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So they hand over cash,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,take a receipt,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and feel doubly good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tax law does allow relief on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But here is the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cash above 2,000 rupees gets zero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,tax relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay by UPI or bank transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.85,0:00:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,most trusts count only half your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,donation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your real saving is smaller still.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The default new tax regime gives
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,no donation relief at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the trust is approved,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and get its donation certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,who gives cash donations to save
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,tax.
